## Platform and Capabilities

### Government Experience Cloud (GXC)

The Government Experience Cloud (GXC) is Granicus's unified platform that brings together digital services, resident communications, government websites, and operational tools — along with data-driven insights, AI capabilities, and experience services — into a single ecosystem. GXC solutions can be used independently or together as an integrated suite.

### Intelligence, Automation, and Services

- **Granicus Experience Intelligence (GXI)**: The experience intelligence layer of the platform that measures resident behavior, engagement, and sentiment across digital touchpoints, enabling data-informed improvements to government digital experiences.
- **AI-powered capabilities (including GXA)**: Artificial intelligence and automation applied across GXC to provide accurate, 24/7 self-service and operational support using approved government data and staff oversight.
- **Customer Experience Services**: Expert services that help governments design, optimize, and operate digital experiences using Granicus technology and insights.

### Government Experience Agent (GXA)

The Government Experience Agent (GXA) is an AI-powered digital agent that provides residents with instant, accurate answers based on approved agency content. GXA is available 24/7 and helps reduce call volume and staff workload while improving access to information. AI capabilities in Granicus are applied responsibly using approved government data and are designed to support — not replace — public sector staff.


